fix(soup): v0.23.4 integration — SessionListSearch, SessionLogPanel title, ACP title tests

Post-merge integration gaps from the v0.23.4 bump:
 - share/index.tsx: upstream #1103 made SessionListSearch.sessionActivityDates
   required; /share picker call-site passes an empty set (no activity dots there).
 - HappyThread.tsx: trace-graph merge dropped the outlineTitle prop plumbing but
   left SessionLogPanel title={props.outlineTitle}; derive inline from metadata.
 - AcpSdkBackend.test.ts: upstream #1028 title tests assert synchronously, but the
   ACP inline-image layer wraps session updates in an async sessionUpdateQueue;
   await that queue before asserting (feature works, timing changed).

